{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：13:38 2026-10-30 HKT<br/>發佈時間：13:38 2026-10-30 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：13:38 2026-10-30 HKT</p><img alt=\"警員將肇事電單車移開。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/242d28b094d4b8d11071f312514174c0/2026-10/555_14.jpg\"/><p>今（30日）中午12時51分，一輛電單車沿青康路行駛，途至青康邨對開，遭一輛轉入邨內的私家車攔腰撞倒，電單車人仰車翻，鐵騎士飛彈地上受傷，電單車嚴重損毀，司機大驚報警，將鐵騎士送院治理。</p><img alt=\"救護員替傷者急救。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d0dfaecb187e39b5fa300d25c1f3d458/2026-10/21_16.jpg\"/><img alt=\"電單車橫亘路中。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fe2b50411c35d8e72bd4e28e1ae4a83d/2026-10/22_0_16.jpg\"/><img alt=\"警員移動電單車。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/13ea8bae9095f6e1aa898516b3e400f4/2026-10/01_1_47.jpg\"/><img alt=\"肇事私家車轉入長康邨時與電單車相撞。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d4fe2500d580d6772f714995170b0c21/2026-10/02_55.jpg\"/><img alt=\"大批警員到場。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/43677186a30657a2121a8142c9a704a0/2026-10/03_1_39.jpg\"/><img alt=\"警員在場調查意外原因。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cf1cd03753c39887e8a3324b69400d0f/2026-10/05_1_34.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T06:05:27.765692+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":176,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T05:38:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T09:19:47.803049+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T06:00:18.511296+00:00","content_hash":"28120025f94c8f73e74ae5e1bef1b7d085dda0293cacd7d5f34774aa81d5b818","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}